// Adapted from shaders/Goo/index.ts and its
// emitted WGSL: the seven Gaussian charges, occupancy blend, wet surface
// surface, Beer-Lambert subsurface, wet highlight and clearcoat equations.
// Font adaptation: the source square maps to the word box, while shape distance
// uses glyph height. Analytic charge gradients and the cached smooth glyph normal
// replace forward differences of an 8-bit distance texture; the x derivative is
// scaled by height/width so the surface normal uses isotropic physical units.
// The flat glyph has no 3D front-depth channel. High containment
// resolves to exact font coverage; lower containment can bulge within a bounded
// 28px SDF halo. Color is linear sRGB then display-encoded and premultiplied.

